Description:
Morrigan Partners Limited (“Morrigan”) is the leading developer of Security Solutions and Mobile Device Management software for smart phones and mobile devices. Morrigan successfully designed and developed the ‘Morrigan Secure Application’ (the “MSA”), a patent-pending software solution that provides secure and encrypted communication between mobile devices, tablets, PDA’s and desktop units. The MSA protects the integrity of private voice conversations, text messages, voicemail and data communications. 

The MSA’s features include:

•	Secure and encrypted voice, voicemail, text messaging and data communication (e.g. documents, photos, video, audio);
•	Centralised Mobile Device Management and Transaction Management with centralised access management controls and the ability to run all services from the cloud;
•	Standards based solution capable of mass deployment to commercially available smart phones and mobile devices;
•	Optional Product enhancements: 
          > Encrypted conference calling; 
          > Secure email;
          > Trojan detection software;
          > GPS Location- “Man Down” alerts.
          > Secure file management for mobile devices

The MSA runs in parallel to standard unencrypted mobile device systems (COTS: Commercial Off-The-Shelf Smartphones) so there is no requirement for any specialist hardware. It is security software capable of instant, mass, global deployment across standard communication networks using standard smart phones and tablets.
